    {
      "file_path": "TODO.md",
      "height": 80,
      "id": "d880fb1e6b7fad01",
      "line_num": 180,
      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [
        "#ai",
        "#agent",
        "#automation"
      ],
      "text": "**Ralph-loop agent mode: run an agent loop against TODO.md as the state file \u2014 each iteration picks the next unfinished item, works it, checks it off, commits. Fresh context per pass via `claude -p` in a bash loop (true Ralph) or `/loop` with `CLAUDE_CODE_AUTO_COMPACT_WINDOW` lowered to force frequent compaction (approximation). TODO.md is already the ideal Ralph state file.**\n`#ai` `#agent` `#automation`\n`TODO.md:L180`",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 280,
      "x": 10,
      "y": 420
    },
