          "checked": true,
          "line_num": 65,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "`scanner/live.py`: watchdog observer per registered local repo \u2014 lazy start/stop with subscribers, 400ms debounce, ignores its own `KANBAN.canvas` writes"
        },
        {
          "checked": true,
          "line_num": 66,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "`/events/<repo>` persistent SSE channel with heartbeats; GitHub webhook publishes to it; cloned repos poll git at 60s while subscribed"
        },
